    "identifier": "wind-release-raging-gale",
    "description": "<p>You manifest a powerful torrent of wind, strong enough to lift and throw most creatures.</p>\n<p>Select a point you can see within range. A spiraling torrent of wind erupts upwards. All creatures within a 10-foot radius originating from the chosen point must make a Strength saving throw. On a failed save they are thrown 30 feet upwards and are then forcefully slammed back to the ground, taking 2d10 wind damage and are left Prone.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d10. If this jutsu is cast at B-Rank or higher, creature with ranks of an Elemental condition and fail their saving throw has the ranks of each of those conditions increased by +1.</p>",
